g_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763250/extras/3788b73c8317816a8788b68b982440e0.poster.avif?t=1754653866\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763250/extras/3788b73c8317816a8788b68b982440e0.webm?t=1754653866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763250/extras/3788b73c8317816a8788b68b982440e0.mp4?t=1754653866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game currently includes the following content:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500 usable cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 different NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 completely distinct Boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 100 events that may help you or get you into deep trouble.</p>",
